## Mdbook

### Binaries

*build via cargo*

- sudo cargo install mdbook
- sudo cargo install mdbook-toc

*or grab binaries*

- Grab the latest binary from [here](https://github.com/rust-lang/mdBook/releases).
 - Unzip it and copy it to your bin directory.  Soo simple!
- [mdbook-toc](https://fnordig.de/2019/07/11/mdbook-toc-and-mermaid-preprocessors/)
 - https://github.com/badboy/mdbook-toc/releases

If toc isn't working you probably have trailing space around this:
~~~
<!-- toc -->
~~~

### Generating pages

- mdbook watch 
